  "diagnosis_plain": "Warm baseline body is ~3.3s. It is NOT sync-bound on the 40 route-id readbacks (those memcpy 62us total). It is NOT a 23ms/CB GPU tax: that average folded host I/O into CB count. Split: GPU occupancy ~2.08s (61%) with wait\u2248gpu (extra wait only 0.15s); host exclusive ~1.19s (35%). Isolated kernels: FP8/FP4 matvecs are 0.2-0.7ms; serial act_quant authority is 3.5ms x ~9/layer \u2248 1.35s of the GPU. Host I/O is mmap+memcpy of ~8GB/token (attn 4.7GB, experts 3.4GB, shared 1.1GB). verify_ns ~1.7s is the SUM of parallel mmap-verify threads, not wall. Right fixes: (1) replace serial act_quant, (2) remove host copies / overlap I/O with GPU. Route-id readbacks force a CB split for streaming residency but are not the dominant cost.",
